  "description": "After she gets caught up in a scandal and is exiled to a remote provincial hospital, all Hyo-Weon wants is to live a quiet life as a resident doctor. But her peace is soon shattered by Hae-Joo, a flirty patient notorious for seducing everyone in his path. Following a particularly stressful week, Hyo-Weon hooks up with Hae-Joo on the spur of the moment. As they continue their secret fling, the unlikely pair learn that they have more in common than they thought...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of CNC Revolution's OOTD Danpyeonseon (OOTD 단편선) Collection.*",
